WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.894
Nvidia accounting under

00:00:01.706 --> 00:00:03.734
SEC investigation sources

00:00:03.546 --> 00:00:04.100
say

00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:06.277
Nvidia is reportedly

00:00:06.088 --> 00:00:07.880
under SEC investigation

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.729
over its accounting

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:10.038
according to sources

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:10.888
cited by Yahoo

00:00:10.699 --> 00:00:11.418
Finance

00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:12.373
as the stock

00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:13.234
extends a sharp

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:13.836
sell-off

00:00:14.374 --> 00:00:15.694
Nvidia shed about

00:00:15.506 --> 00:00:18.418
$485 billion in market

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.220
value Friday

00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:21.614
and nearly $900 billion

00:00:21.426 --> 00:00:22.050
this week

00:00:22.263 --> 00:00:23.088
as its stock

00:00:22.912 --> 00:00:23.690
had its worst

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.647
week since October 2008

00:00:26.174 --> 00:00:27.176
6 record

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.591
Nvidia has lost

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.549
about $2.7 trillion

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.457
in market value

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:32.294
more than the

00:00:32.106 --> 00:00:34.086
$2.5 trillion that

00:00:33.898 --> 00:00:35.053
The Kobeissi Letter

00:00:34.865 --> 00:00:35.926
called the biggest

00:00:35.738 --> 00:00:37.353
45-day loss for

00:00:37.353 --> 00:00:38.190
any stock in

00:00:38.002 --> 00:00:38.744
history

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.284
Full story on

00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:40.991
the dashboard
